.TH TDXCTL 1 "2026-09-04" "tdx 0.19" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tdxctl \- talk to tdx or tdxview over a UNIX socket
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tdxctl
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.I command
[\fIargs\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tdxctl
sends one JSON command per invocation (or a keep-alive pipeline with
.BR \-\-ctl )
to
.B tdx (1)
or
.B tdxview (1).
Stdout is product data (screenshot path, dump path, JSON).
Stderr is errors.
.P
Prefer
.B unpause
over
.B run
(F9 toggles).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-sock " PATH"
Socket path. Default
.I /tmp/tdx.sock
, or
.I /tmp/tdxview.sock
with
.BR \-\-view .
.TP
.B \-\-view
Talk to tdxview (game window shots and keys).
.TP
.B \-\-ctl
Keep-alive: commands on stdin, one connect.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B unpause
Resume execution.
.TP
.B pause , stop
Pause.
.TP
.B run
Toggle F9 run/pause (same as the CPU key).
.TP
.BI delay " [N|+|-]"
F9 slice park in milliseconds. 0 is fastest.
.TP
.B faster , slower
Change delay by 5 ms.
.TP
.B step , step-in
One instruction (into CALL/INT).
.TP
.B over , step-over
Step over CALL, INT, REP, LOOP.
.TP
.B regs , status , cga , ping
JSON status / CGA frame.
.TP
.BI "dump cga " [FILE]
16 KiB from B800:0000 to
.I SCREEN.CGA
(default).
.TP
.BI "dump mda " [FILE]
4 KiB from B000:0000 to
.I SCREEN.MDA
(default).
.TP
.BI "dump " "seg:off len [FILE]"
Arbitrary range.
.TP
.BI "key " KEY
Inject a DOS INT 16h key (starts run).
.TP
.BI "shot " [path]
Screenshot; stdout is the versioned path.
.TP
.B bp , bpint , bpinsn , bpm , bpdel , bplist
Breakpoints (see
.B tdxctl \-h
for full forms).
.TP
.B quit
Ask tdx to exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Socket or protocol error.
.TP
.B 2
Bad command line.
.SH EXAMPLES
Dump CGA VRAM:
.RS
.B tdxctl dump cga
.RE
Unpause at 0 ms delay:
.RS
.B tdxctl delay 0
.br
.B tdxctl unpause
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tdx (1),
.BR tdxview (1)
